> 
> The monster is a **displacer beast**: a pony-sized black panther with **six legs**, two long barbed tentacles growing from its shoulders, glowing blue-violet eyes, and an unsettling magical shimmer that makes it seem to stand a few feet away from where it truly is.
> 
> Its name, if Ekemon earns its trust, is **Nightclaw**.
> 
> It is scary enough to make a Bastion feel like a Titan’s fortress—but it is not evil, and it should not be treated as magically enslaved. It may choose to make the Bastion its home if Ekemon gives it safety, space, and respect.
