> For a straightforward **D&D 5e creek ambush**, use standard goblin and wolf statistics:
> 
> | Creature | Number | AC | HP | Attacks |
> |---|---:|---:|---:|---|
> | Goblin | 5 | 15 (leather armor, shield) | 7 each | **Scimitar:** +4 to hit, $1d6+2$ slashing. **Shortbow:** +4 to hit, range 80/320 ft., $1d6+2$ piercing. |
> | Wolf | 2 | 13 (natural armor) | 11 each | **Bite:** +4 to hit, $2d4+2$ piercing. Target must make a **DC 11 Strength save** or fall prone, provided the wolf had an ally within 5 feet of the target and that ally isn’t incapacitated. |
